    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "系统受到一个短脉冲（脉冲输入）的激励，其作用是在时间 t=5 sec 时赋予系统一个非零角度 theta0。由于系统是无阻尼的，在没有任何控制的情况下，它将以 t=5 sec 时脉冲赋予的角速度保持等速漂移。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The system is excited with a short pulse (an impulse input) that has the effect of imparting a nonzero angle theta0 at time t=5 sec on the system. Because the system is undamped, in the absence of any control it drifts with constant angular velocity with a value imparted by the impulse at t=5 sec.",
